version: "DRAFT-1"
abstract: >-
  The Washington County Federal Fiscal Balance Project (WCFFBP) is an open,
  reproducible research project for measuring federal fiscal flows attributable
  to Washington State and, ultimately, its 39 counties. The project develops
  source provenance, accounting policy, reconciliation, validation, geographic
  attribution, and reproducible methods for comparing federal inflows to
  federal outflows.
keywords:
  - federal fiscal balance
  - Washington State
  - county fiscal balance
  - federal expenditures
  - federal receipts
  - fiscal federalism
  - reproducible research